WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:36.030
I'm Kurata Sana, a first-year student at Jinbo Middle School.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:38.240
Manager, Rei-kun.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:41.200
Brad, who looks like my Japanese friend.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.330
Broadway choreographer, Michelle Hamilton.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:47.620
Her husband is the king producer, Gary Hamilton.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:50.130
Their only child, Sicil.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:53.920
Naozumi-kun's mother, who appeared suddenly, Yuko Mizukuchi.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.510
She's a little suspicious.

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.510
The marvelous white bat, Babbit.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:01.430
You have to resolve your own problems... that's how I'll say it.

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:05.520
My best friend in New York, Naozumi-kun.

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:09.900
I have something to discuss with Naozumi-kun's mother...

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:13.860
...the important things between women.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:19.740
Daughter, Where in
Manhattan Are You?

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:24.410
Are you going to eat it?

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.120
Yes.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:32.710
It's disgusting.

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.090
Our store might not stay in business for much longer.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.130
Disgusting.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.180
Good afternoon.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.810
G-Good afternoon.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.100
Yuko-san...

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:54.480
You haven't done anything that would hurt Naozumi-kun, right?

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.110
What kind of things?

00:02:56.110 --> 00:03:00.030
You want me to mention everything?

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.070
Go ahead.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.580
I'll say it.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:12.580
You want to get close to Naozumi-kun so that you can use him.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:17.420
That's part of your plan to win the lead female part.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.640
It's not out of a mother's feelings.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:27.640
You want to become a successful female actress. That's why you're using him.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.480
Isn't that it?

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.980
That's right.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.980
You admit it so easily?!

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.690
What's wrong with that?

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:40.570
Isn't it a mother's right to do whatever she wants with her son?

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.570
Even more unbelievable!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.950
If you shout this loudly, he'll hear you.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.870
What do you want to say?

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.710
At least...

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.500
If you're going to lie to him, at least continue the lie.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.800
Please continue to be his mother.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:03.090
I'm begging you.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.340
This is all you wanted to discuss?

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:19.230
Where's Sana-chan?

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:22.280
Because you didn't go to dance practice at the theater...

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.200
...your friend said she was lonely and left.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:28.910
You should return to practice.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.700
That's what you discussed with Sana-chan?

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.420
That's what you discussed?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:37.000
Yes. That's what we discussed.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:41.300
Naozumi, is she jealous of me?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:44.760
She told me to return you to her.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:48.260
That's right, Naozumi, why don't you return to her side?

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:51.890
That's what you were talking about?

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.850
That's was really it?

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.980
That's what we were talking about.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:05:02.110
I want to always be with Mother.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.660
This current performance...

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:09.780
...I actually want to reconsider it.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.580
The reason Gary-san invited me here...

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:15.870
That? That was my mistake.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:20.170
It doesn't matter how bad the person is, he's still your birth father.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.090
Right?

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.760
Birth father?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:27.590
I feel that Gary is also concerned about your welfare.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:32.930
Therefore, why don't you return to your father's theater?

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:37.190
Father? Naozumi's father?

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.770
I can't start thinking that way so quickly!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:43.480
Go back!
I don't like disobedient children.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:46.820
Starting tomorrow, you'll return to practice. Do you hear me?!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.990
Sicil!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.990
The stuff we just said...

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:55.500
It seems like she heard.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.290
Sicil!

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:09.970
Leaning against your shoulder...

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:14.890
...I don't know why, but I'm even lonelier than before.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:20.480
I wish we could keep walking through this forest.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:26.280
You can understand, right?

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:31.700
Even though I hear gentle words...

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:39.500
...you actually meant to lie to me.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:44.630
Please keep lying to me until I die.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:47.090
Please keep lying to me until I die.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:50.050
Shut up, you two are so noisy!

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.680
Where did she run off to?

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:07.570
We're here! Thank you!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.150
Hey!

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:09.070
Hey!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.030
You're jogging at this late hour?

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.160
Isn't Sicil with you?

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.080
No. Why?

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.160
I thought you guys were together.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.660
What happened to Sicil?

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:23.040
Just now, that stupid guy was wandering on the street, holding a pot.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.590
I found out after asking him...

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:29.170
Where did Sicil run off to?
What a pain.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:31.260
Gary is going to kill me.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:36.680
Sicil! Sicil! Where did you go?!

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.060
Sicil's missing, the curry rice is cold. What do I do? Asako...

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:45.060
Rei-kun, did you find Sicil?

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.980
I can't find her anywhere.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:49.360
So pathetic.

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:52.780
Sicil! Sicil! Sicil!

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.070
Where did she go?

00:07:56.490 --> 00:08:00.200
Hurry up, hurry up and answer, Sana-chan.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:01.500
Hello.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.500
Sana-chan!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.790
Oh, is this Naozumi-kun's voice?

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.000
Sana-chan, just now...

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:11.170
Naozumi-kun, she's gone! Sicil's gone!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.170
Just as I thought!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.970
Just as you thought? Naozumi-kun, did something happen?

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.350
In any case, I'll meet up with you right away. Bye.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:27.190
Boy, it's dangerous for kids to be in this kind of place at night.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:31.070
Yes. I'm going home right away.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:34.200
What? She overheard that?!

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.410
Yeah.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:41.080
Hey, this is the first time I've heard that Naozumi-kun's father is Gary.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:44.210
That means that Sicil is...
his younger sister!

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.250
Slow!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.960
This is the only thing I didn't want Sicil to find out.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.300
What about Bernie?

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:51.300
She still hasn't returned.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.800
Or maybe she already went back home?

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.050
Maybe.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:56.720
Rei-kun, phone!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:00.680
What's the matter?

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.100
I'm afraid to call.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.810
Why?

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:08.020
Because he promised Gary-san that if anything happened to Sicil,

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.070
he would pay with his life.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:13.110
Geez! I'll call!
Tell me the phone number!

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:18.070
I don't care. I'll give you my life.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:22.120
Hamilton-san? Yes, it's me.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:27.210
Because Sicil-san hasn't returned...

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:30.670
Yes. Yes. I understand.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.250
Rei-kun...

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:36.470
Sicil didn't return home. He's coming here with Michelle-san.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.760
What'll we do?

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.390
What are you doing?

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:44.430
Rei-kun has made up his mind

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.390
Try wearing this.

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.270
Where did she go?

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:49.150
The two have come

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:52.900
In any case, Sicil overheard that, right?

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:53.900
Yes.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:55.070
I see.

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:58.360
It's all your fault, Gary.

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:00.370
Perhaps.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:04.290
She's a fragile child.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:10.880
If something happens to Sicil, I... I...

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.170
Saying all of this nonsense is not going to help find Sicil!

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.550
Our only choice is to split up to look for her!

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.090
I'm going to go look for her.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.300
Yes!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.640
I'm going too!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.310
- This way!
- OK.

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:29.400
I'm going to the New York Police. The chief is a friend of mine.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.400
I'm going to ask him to search this area.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:31.980
Michelle!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.320
What?

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:35.110
You stay here.

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:38.990
What?! Why do I have to stay here?!

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:41.910
Sicil might return here.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:46.580
She hasn't returned by this time.
How long do you expect me to wait?

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:50.040
How can you still be so calm at this time.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.420
Right now, my Sicil could be...

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.880
- Sagami.
- Yes.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:56.090
Please take care of things here.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.590
Wait a minute.
Why are you leaving me here?!

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:01.840
Ma'am!

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.180
Get out of my way, Sagami.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.350
Remaining calm right now is the most important thing, Michelle-san!

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:09.770
Sicil!

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:13.560
Sorry to bother you, chief. Thank you for helping me.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:15.770
If you want any tickets, please let me know anytime.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.820
And a free ticket for your wife as well, of course. Bye.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.210
I'm sorry.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:37.670
It's ok.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.720
You know where she might be?

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.470
I don't know either.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.470
What's the matter?!

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.560
Running around everywhere is useless.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:54.900
We have to think about where Sicil might go.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:58.280
Sicil is very sad.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.860
She must be thinking about suicide.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.160
Thinking about suicide?

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:09.290
What?! There's a girl who's thinking about jumping from the billboard of a theater?

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:20.050
{parte b}

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:23.010
Babbit's counting song

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:26.010
One. Two. One, two, three, four.

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:28.890
Folk dancing is a happy kind of dance.

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.980
Why don't you dance with that cute girl?

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.980
Folk dancing is a happy kind of dance.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.900
Why don't you dance with that cute girl?

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:40.900
One. Two. One, two, three, five.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:44.200
Five. Face is so red.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.740
When you have a fever, you must rest.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.870
Five. Face is so red.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:52.870
When you have a fever, you must rest.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:55.920
One. Two. One, two, three, six.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:58.750
Six. Six. Can't stop.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.880
Hiccupping. Six. Can't stop.

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:05.050
Six. Six. Can't stop.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:08.350
Hiccupping. Six. Can't stop.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:11.060
We'll continue to sing next time.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:17.350
Hello?

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:18.560
Sana-chan?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.770
I just talked to Naozumi-kun.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:24.860
He says that there's a girl who's thinking of jumping from the top of a theater!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.030
Where?

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:27.200
Sicil!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.280
Please step back!

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:30.780
If you know something, please tell me.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:33.160
Right. Get the rescue
team ready. And the net?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.660
Almost ready.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.170
Sicil!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.760
This is the place from her memories?

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.390
Yeah. This is the theater where she hurt her foot.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.760
The place that caused her to be unable to dance.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.770
Excuse me. Sorry.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:57.270
Sorry. Excuse me. Sorry.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:14:00.560
No. No. You can't go beyond this point. Step back.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.400
Let me pass.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.480
- No. No.
- Sicil!

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:05.070
That girl might be Sicil.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:09.490
No means no. Leave these things to us.

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:12.490
Sicil! Don't die!

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:14.790
Sicil!

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.370
Sicil! Return to Mama's side!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.210
Let's talk about this calmly.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:23.670
Stop! Don't die!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:28.680
No!

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:37.480
Don't let go! Don't let go of my hand!

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.400
Don't give up!
You have to keep on living!

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.440
It's ok now. It's ok now.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:43.150
I'm going to pull you up now.

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:46.190
One. Two. Three. Pull.

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.450
Great!

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.240
We pulled her up.

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:55.830
Thank God. You are so precious to me.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:59.330
You're the famous producer,
Gary Hamilton-san!

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:02.500
Hamilton-san told me not to kill myself.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.880
I still have hope.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:07.590
I won't kill myself.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.010
Who are you?

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.180
Thank you very much.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.550
It's not Sicil.

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:13.970
Wrong person.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:16.850
At the construction site
at East Second Street...

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:20.560
...there's a girl...
who's fallen down the ditch.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:23.860
Sicil, I'm going to rescue you.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.690
Sana, we'll hurry there too.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.150
Sicil!

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:29.990
Come on. Come on.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.570
Sicil.

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:32.780
Don't move.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:33.490
Come on. Come on.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:36.660
Don't tell me Sicil...

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.000
Sicil. Where's Sicil?

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.620
Hey! Return my Sicil to me!

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.120
We're finally protecting the alligators.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.750
I don't care what happens to the alligator.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:46.800
The girl who fell down the ditch...
Where's Sicil?

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:50.470
Actually... it was a small female alligator that fell down the ditch.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:53.470
A small female alligator?

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:57.600
The young girl who was sleepwalking in the park was protected by a guy.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.270
No. It's not Sicil.

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:03.270
At Giants Stadium, the girl who came in contact with the soccer player has fallen.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.770
Now a female has rushed to the scene.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.060
It's not Sicil.

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:10.400
Someone has reported seeing a young girl entering the lions' cage at the zoo.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.280
It's there!

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.780
The zoo?

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:16.280
Right. It was Sicil's
favorite place as a child.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.200
Alright! We've found her this time.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.700
Hurry.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.540
Over here... come over here.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.880
Husband...

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:36.300
If something happens to Sicil...

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:40.810
I'll stab myself in the gut in atonement.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.480
It hurts!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.400
I'm really afraid of pain!

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.150
And you still want to stab yourself in the gut?

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:52.490
I don't know what else to do.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:55.200
Even if you do this,
it won't bring Sicil back...

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.200
There seems to be activity at the protection center.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:01.580
The girl who was sleeping in the lion feeding pen has been safely rescued.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:05.370
She thought that if she slept with the lions, she might dream a very happy dream.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:06.580
It's not Sicil.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.250
Therefore, she entered the lion feeding pen.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.880
It doesn't matter who it is, as long as they're safe.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:14.260
We've just received breaking news.

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.760
There's a young girl who's fallen into the Hudson River.

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:20.260
Don't say any more!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:23.560
I'm going to find her. Sicil...

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:27.270
Dressed like that...

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:33.070
Sicil. Why don't you come in?

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:34.990
Found Sicil

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:34.570
Sicil.

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:42.580
I'm sorry, but I didn't
have anywhere else to go.

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:46.460
Don't worry. As long as you're safe.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:50.880
No one loves me.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.170
Everyone lies to me.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.840
Nobody cares about me.

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.890
Nobody needs me.

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:06.480
They invited Naozumi over to replace me because I can't dance anymore.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.400
They just needed someone to take my place.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.610
It's true I don't know the reason...

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:16.570
I don't need to know
and I don't want to know.

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:17.900
Really?

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:22.280
Papa and Mama won't tell me.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:27.370
Naozumi is the same. Everyone's a liar.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:31.790
Still haven't?

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.210
What are you doing? Hurry up and get a powerboat over here.

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:38.010
It's just today that we're experiencing difficulties with the rescue team.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:40.680
Don't argue.
Hurry up and do something.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:44.600
Never mind.
I don't need to depend on others.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:48.270
In my student years, I was termed a diving queen. I'm going in.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.900
Sicil!

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.610
Go, Michelle!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.990
Success! Successfully rescued!

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.240
The wrong person again?

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:10.750
Yes! She's here!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.380
She's here safe!

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.170
Can't make out what you're saying anymore, Rei-kun.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:16.670
Thank you.

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:19.380
Everyone's coming back.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:21.260
They're not coming.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.760
I want to be with Bernie forever.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.060
How long are you going to act this way?

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.850
Everyone is really worried about you.

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:39.700
Papa... Mama...

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:45.160
Sicil, look closely at your Papa and your Mama's appearance.

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:50.870
I've been searching for you...

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:54.580
Thank God, you're safe.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:58.090
Thank God. Thank God.

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.590
Papa.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.890
Mama.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.970
Made people worry.

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.980
Thank God.

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:15.980
Naozumi-kun.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:20.400
Naozumi's situation?

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:19.990
That's right. Under these circumstances, what should Naozumi-kun do?

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.900
Naozumi-kun.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:29.080
Naozumi-kun.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:34.290
I'm going to return to my mother's house.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:40.300
I still want to be with my mother.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.800
Bye.

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:48.810
If you're going to lie to him,
at least continue to lie to him.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.480
Please continue to be his mother.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:55.770
It'll be ok, right?

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:02.360
For you. This is your luggage.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.700
I... I want to be with Mom.

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.740
Return to practice.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.660
I said before I dislike disobedient children.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.660
I can go to the practice site from here. Therefore...

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.580
No!

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:20.170
I promised Gary that I would break all ties with you.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:26.720
Honestly. If I don't do this then he won't sponsor my performances.

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:31.850
The stage is my life.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.940
I'll use anything.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:38.150
I don't want any burdens.

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:41.320
Because you're a burden,
I abandoned you.

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.130
Why did you say such things?

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:01.750
Because he really is a burden.

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.960
Bastard!

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:05.760
I...

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:12.430
My trumpet is in the bedroom, right?

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:28.910
Nao... zumi-kun.

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:39.250
matte  mou wakaretai no yo

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:39.250
"Wait... I want us to split up", I said

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:44.500
ima  KISU wo sorashinagara itta

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:44.500
Just now, when I turned away from your kiss

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:50.010
Gutto  tsukihanasu kono me ni

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:50.010
Under the gaze of my sharp, firm eyes

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:55.430
odoroite  anata wa damatta ne

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:55.430
You were startled, and didn't say a word

00:22:55.970 --> 00:23:00.440
tooranakya ikenai michi wo

00:22:55.970 --> 00:23:00.440
You can't see what's in front of you

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:05.650
saketecha  saki wa mienai janai

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:05.650
If you walk off the road you have to go along

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:10.950
GURUGURU to tada  mayoikomu yori mo

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:10.950
Let's gather some courage and set this straight now

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:17.160
hakkiri to ima  yuuki wo dasou yo

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:17.160
Rather than walking around in circles

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:23.880
Love Me Deeper  daite  kizutsuketai

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:23.880
Love me deeper, hold me, I wanna hurt you

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:29.130
Touch Me, PINCH ni oitsumete ageru

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:29.130
ouch me, I'll pin you down with this pinch

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:34.100
Deeper Deeper  hayaku  honki ni natte

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:34.100
Deeper, deeper, quick  get real

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.230
anata to naite mitai kara

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.230
Because I wanna try crying with you

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:44.730
Love Me Deeper  daite  umarekawatte

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:44.730
Love me deeper, hold me, be reborn

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:50.030
Hold Me, PINCH wo kirinukete hoshii

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:50.030
Take me, I want you to get through this pinch

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:55.120
Deeper Deeper  hayaku  me wo samashite

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:55.120
Deeper, deeper, quick  open your eyes

00:23:55.830 --> 00:24:02.250
watashi hitori wo  sou aishite

00:23:55.830 --> 00:24:02.250
And make me  the only one you love

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:10.800
Hi. What will happen on next weeks' Kodomo no Omocha?

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.430
What's wrong with that woman? Seriously!

00:24:13.430 --> 00:24:15.220
Everyone has problems. It's the same in America.

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:17.720
Go home. Let's go home. Let's not live in this kind of place anymore.

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:20.730
What's the big deal about the musical? What's the big deal about Gary Hamilton?

00:24:20.730 --> 00:24:21.730
What's the big deal about a birth father anyway?

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:25.520
We have to walk our own path in live, Naozumi-kun. Right? Right?

00:24:25.520 --> 00:24:30.110
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode 76: Big Bastard. Bye bye.

00:24:30.110 --> 00:24:32.240
Let's go home. Let's go home.

00:24:32.240 --> 00:24:35.160
On the way home, please buy me some cigarettes and perfume.
